{
  "title": "8W8",
  "children": [
    {
      "title": "Overview",
      "lines": [
        "TR-808 style drum",
        "machine. 15 voices,",
        "all synthesized,",
        "no samples. Kick,",
        "snare, toms, congas,",
        "rim/clave, maracas,",
        "clap, cowbell, hats",
        "and cymbal."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Playing",
      "lines": [
        "Pads (left 4x4):",
        " r1: BD SD LT MT",
        " r2: HT LC MC HC",
        " r3: RS MA CP CB",
        " r4: CH OH CY Mst",
        "",
        "Shift+Pad: select",
        " without sounding.",
        "Mute+Pad: mute that",
        " drum ([M] in bar)."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Editing",
      "lines": [
        "Knobs 1-8 edit the",
        "page on screen.",
        "Jog: next page.",
        "Shift+Jog: jump",
        " section.",
        "Jog click: section",
        " list.",
        "Shift: show values",
        " and fine mode.",
        "Mute+knob: reset",
        " that pot."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Voices",
      "lines": [
        "Every drum has Tune,",
        "Decay, Drive, a",
        "Distortion type and",
        "Level. Defaults are",
        "the sc808 sound, not",
        "pot centre.",
        "",
        "Rim / Clave share a",
        "lane with a Mode",
        "switch, like the",
        "808's own RS/CL."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Choke",
      "lines": [
        "The 808 shares one",
        "metal source between",
        "the hats, so closed",
        "cuts open. Here it",
        "is a switch:",
        " Off / CH>OH /",
        " Mutual.",
        "On the Closed Hat",
        "page and on Master."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Distortion",
      "lines": [
        "Per drum and across",
        "the kit: Diode,",
        "Clip, Fold, Crush.",
        "Same four as 9W9",
        "and 6W6, so the",
        "knob means the same",
        "thing on all three.",
        "",
        "Master Dist has an",
        "Off position."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Sequencing",
      "lines": [
        "Use Move's own",
        "sequencer: a drum",
        "track with a kit,",
        "muted (HiJack),",
        "track MIDI OUT on",
        "the slot's channel.",
        "",
        "Notes 36-50, one",
        "lane per drum, or",
        "General MIDI -",
        "switch on Master."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Accent",
      "lines": [
        "Velocity 100 and up",
        "gets the Accent",
        "multiplier, on the",
        "Master page.",
        "Default is 2x, the",
        "same as 9W9 and",
        "6W6."
      ]
    }
  ]
}
